  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1301.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1301.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to healthcare facilities and reverse distributors, except as provided in 40 CFR 266 Subpart P as incorporated by reference in Env-Hw 1302.01.\n\nSource. #13407, eff 7-23-22",
